{
  "key": 54403,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_FriendsItchingToBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "I came here with some friends to\n",
        "catch us some Bug Pokémon!\r",
        "They’re all itching to get into\n",
        "some Pokémon battles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_RanOutOfPokeBalls",
      "en_US": [
        "I was throwing Poké Balls to\n",
        "catch Pokémon, and I ran out.\r",
        "That’s why you can never have too\n",
        "many Poké Balls."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_RickIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey! You have Pokémon!\n",
        "Come on!\f",
        "Let’s battle ’em!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_RickPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Ssh! You’ll scare the bugs away.\n",
        "Another time, okay?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_AvoidGrassyAreasWhenWeak",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "If your Pokémon are weak and you\n",
        "want to avoid battles, stay away\f",
        "from grassy areas!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_ContactOakViaPCToRatePokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Contact Prof. Oak via a PC to\n",
        "get your Pokédex evaluated!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_CantCatchOwnedMons",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "You can’t catch a Pokémon that\n",
        "belongs to someone else.\r",
        "Throw Poké Balls only at wild\n",
        "Pokémon to catch them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_LeavingViridianForest",
      "en_US": [
        "Leaving Viridian Forest\n",
        "PEWTER City Ahead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_UseAntidoteForPoison",
      "en_US": [
        "For poison, use Antidote!\n",
        "Get it at Pokémon Marts!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_ViridianForest_Text_WeakenMonsBeforeCapture",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Weaken Pokémon before attempting\n",
        "capture!\r",
        "When healthy, they may escape!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_GymCandidate_Text_RecruitJoined",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} joined your Gym!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_GymCandidate_Text_RecruitHowToPlace",
      "en_US": [
        "Place your new Trainer from the\n",
        "Gym PC, under Trainers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_EventMons_Text_CapFound",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} found the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_EventMons_Text_CapInCase",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} put the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} in\n",
        "the Cap Case."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_GymCandidate_Text_RecruitDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh… OK. If you change your mind,\n",
        "I’ll be right here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_EventMons_Text_CapNoCase",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a little cap stuck here,\n",
        "a Pikachu’s size. Someone must\r",
        "have lost it…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0132_D46R0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
